WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Every punctuation mark has a job.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.800
A capital starts a sentence and a name.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.150
A comma joins or separates.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.570
Quotation marks hold someone’s exact words.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.240
Read your sentence out loud, and ask each mark:

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.060
what’s your job?
